      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُدْرَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A herd</i> of camels, (S, K,) <i>like,</i> or <i>about,
a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِرْمَة</span>, (S,) which is [as some say] from ten to

forty: when they amount to sixty, they are termed
a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِدْعَة</span>: (TA:) <i>a flock</i> of sheep or goats. (Lh,
